# Upload only what the landing page build needs (the branding, the version, the release notes and
# the README's shortcuts): never target/, Docs/ or CLAUDE.md. A file the site reads with
# readFileSync goes here too (ERRORS.md E87).
/*
!/vercel.json
!/Cargo.toml
!/README.md
!/site
/site/node_modules
/site/dist
/site/.astro
!/src
/src/*
!/src/branding.rs
!/src/update
/src/update/*
!/src/update/notes.rs
